## 💡 **Complete Workflows**

### Workflow A: Standard Fulfillment (Pack First, Label Later)

```bash
# 1. Create fulfillment
curl -X POST "http://localhost:3010/api/server/fulfillment/create" \
  -d '{"order": "order-uuid", "fulfill_all": true}'
# Result: status=UNFULFILLED, delivery_status=PENDING
# Order status: Still UNFULFILLED

# 2. Pack the package and mark as fulfilled
curl -X PUT "http://localhost:3010/api/server/fulfillment/fulfill/fulfillment-uuid" \
  -d '{"notes": "Packed by warehouse team A"}'
# Result: status=FULFILLED, delivery_status=PREPARED
# Inventory DEDUCTED!
# Order status: Changes to PARTIALLY_FULFILLED or FULFILLED

# 3. Create shipping label and add tracking
curl -X PUT "http://localhost:3010/api/server/fulfillment/add-tracking/fulfillment-uuid" \
  -d '{
    "tracking": "1Z999AA10123456784",
    "tracking_link": "https://ups.com/track/...",
    "carrier_name": "UPS"
  }'
# Result: delivery_status changes to LABEL_CREATED

# 4. Carrier picks up package
curl -X PUT "http://localhost:3010/api/server/fulfillment/update-status/fulfillment-uuid" \
  -d '{
    "delivery_status": "IN_TRANSIT",
    "carrier_status": "Package picked up from warehouse"
  }'

# 5. Package out for delivery
curl -X PUT "http://localhost:3010/api/server/fulfillment/update-status/fulfillment-uuid" \
  -d '{
    "delivery_status": "OUT_FOR_DELIVERY",
    "carrier_status": "On delivery vehicle"
  }'

# 6. Package delivered
curl -X PUT "http://localhost:3010/api/server/fulfillment/update-status/fulfillment-uuid" \
  -d '{
    "delivery_status": "DELIVERED",
    "carrier_status": "Delivered to recipient"
  }'
```

---

### Workflow B: Label First, Pack Later

```bash
# 1. Create fulfillment
curl -X POST "http://localhost:3010/api/server/fulfillment/create" \
  -d '{"order": "order-uuid", "items": [...]}'
# Result: status=UNFULFILLED

# 2. Create shipping label early
curl -X PUT "http://localhost:3010/api/server/fulfillment/add-tracking/fulfillment-uuid" \
  -d '{"tracking": "1Z999AA10123456784", "carrier_name": "DHL"}'
# Result: status still UNFULFILLED (just added tracking info)

# 3. Pack the package
curl -X PUT "http://localhost:3010/api/server/fulfillment/fulfill/fulfillment-uuid" \
  -d '{"notes": "Package ready for pickup"}'
# Result: status=FULFILLED, delivery_status=LABEL_CREATED
# Inventory DEDUCTED!
# Order status changes

# 4-6. Same as Workflow A (update statuses as package moves)
```

---

### Workflow C: No Tracking (Manual Delivery / Pickup)

```bash
# 1. Create fulfillment
curl -X POST "http://localhost:3010/api/server/fulfillment/create" \
  -d '{"order": "order-uuid", "fulfill_all": true}'

# 2. Pack and fulfill (no tracking)
curl -X PUT "http://localhost:3010/api/server/fulfillment/fulfill/fulfillment-uuid" \
  -d '{"notes": "Store pickup - no tracking needed"}'
# Result: status=FULFILLED, delivery_status=PREPARED
# Inventory DEDUCTED!

# 3. Customer picks up from store
curl -X PUT "http://localhost:3010/api/server/fulfillment/update-status/fulfillment-uuid" \
  -d '{
    "delivery_status": "DELIVERED",
    "carrier_status": "Picked up by customer at store"
  }'
```

---

### Workflow D: Multi-Package Order (Partial Fulfillment)

```bash
# Order has 5 items total

# 1. Create first fulfillment with 3 items
curl -X POST "http://localhost:3010/api/server/fulfillment/create" \
  -d '{
    "order": "order-uuid",
    "items": [
      {"order_item": "item1-uuid", "shipped_quantity": 1},
      {"order_item": "item2-uuid", "shipped_quantity": 2}
    ]
  }'
# Result: Fulfillment #1 created, order.fulfillment_status: UNFULFILLED

# 2. Fulfill first package
curl -X PUT "http://localhost:3010/api/server/fulfillment/fulfill/fulfillment1-uuid" \
  -d '{"notes": "Package 1 of 2 ready"}'
# Result: 3 items inventory deducted
# Order status: PARTIALLY_FULFILLED (3 of 5 items fulfilled)

# 3. Add tracking to package 1
curl -X PUT "http://localhost:3010/api/server/fulfillment/add-tracking/fulfillment1-uuid" \
  -d '{"tracking": "TRACK001", "carrier_name": "DHL"}'

# 4. Create second fulfillment with remaining 2 items
curl -X POST "http://localhost:3010/api/server/fulfillment/create" \
  -d '{
    "order": "order-uuid",
    "items": [
      {"order_item": "item3-uuid", "shipped_quantity": 2}
    ]
  }'
# Result: Fulfillment #2 created, order still PARTIALLY_FULFILLED

# 5. Fulfill second package
curl -X PUT "http://localhost:3010/api/server/fulfillment/fulfill/fulfillment2-uuid" \
  -d '{"notes": "Package 2 of 2 ready"}'
# Result: 2 items inventory deducted
# Order status: FULFILLED (all 5 items now fulfilled!)

# 6. Add tracking to package 2
curl -X PUT "http://localhost:3010/api/server/fulfillment/add-tracking/fulfillment2-uuid" \
  -d '{"tracking": "TRACK002", "carrier_name": "DHL"}'

# Both packages now ship independently
```

---

### Workflow E: Warehouse Mistake (Unfulfill)

```bash
# 1. Created and fulfilled fulfillment
# status=FULFILLED, delivery_status=PREPARED, inventory deducted

# 2. Warehouse realizes wrong items packed
curl -X PUT "http://localhost:3010/api/server/fulfillment/unfulfill/fulfillment-uuid" \
  -d '{"reason": "Wrong items packed - item #2 instead of #3"}'
# Result: status=UNFULFILLED, delivery_status=PENDING
# Inventory restored! Reservations recreated
# Order status: May change back to UNFULFILLED or PARTIALLY_FULFILLED

# 3. Fix the items via MODIFY or CANCEL and create new fulfillment
curl -X PUT "http://localhost:3010/api/server/fulfillment/cancel/fulfillment-uuid" \
  -d '{"reason": "Creating new fulfillment with correct items"}'

# 4. Create correct fulfillment
curl -X POST "http://localhost:3010/api/server/fulfillment/create" \
  -d '{"order": "order-uuid", "items": [correct items]}'

# 5. Fulfill again
curl -X PUT "http://localhost:3010/api/server/fulfillment/fulfill/new-fulfillment-uuid"
```

---

### Workflow F: Lost Package (Reship)

```bash
# 1. Original fulfillment delivered, but package lost
# Tracking shows: delivery_status=FAILED

# 2. Create replacement fulfillment
curl -X POST "http://localhost:3010/api/server/fulfillment/reship/original-fulfillment-uuid" \
  -d '{
    "reason": "Package lost by carrier - confirmed via tracking",
    "notes": "Rush shipping for replacement"
  }'
# Result: New fulfillment created with same items
# New inventory reserved
# Original fulfillment marked with reship note

# 3. Fulfill the replacement
curl -X PUT "http://localhost:3010/api/server/fulfillment/fulfill/new-fulfillment-uuid" \
  -d '{"notes": "Replacement package - expedited"}'

# 4. Add tracking and ship
curl -X PUT "http://localhost:3010/api/server/fulfillment/add-tracking/new-fulfillment-uuid" \
  -d '{"tracking": "NEW-TRACK-123", "carrier_name": "Express Carrier"}'
```

